WEBVTT

00:06:29.927 --> 00:06:31.595
These are ongoing experiments

00:06:31.595 --> 00:06:35.391
in which we put living dragonflies
in virtual reality.

00:06:36.684 --> 00:06:38.602
(Laughter)

00:06:38.644 --> 00:06:42.398
Now, it's not practical to put
VR goggles on a dragonfly.

00:06:43.566 --> 00:06:48.154
So instead, we show movies
of moving targets to the dragonfly,

00:06:48.154 --> 00:06:51.824
while an electrode records activity
patterns of individual neurons

00:06:51.824 --> 00:06:53.075
in the brain.

00:06:54.827 --> 00:06:56.162
Yeah, he likes the movies.

00:06:57.663 --> 00:07:00.291
If the responses
that we record in the brain